  m_Text: "Press Alt Fire to <color=orange>pump</color> your shotgun, increasing the <color=orange>power</color> and decreasing the <color=orange>accuracy</color> of your <color=orange>next shot</color>.\n\nPumping too much will overheat the shotgun, causing an <color=orange>explosion</color>."
